821	 * tenant's writable tree), and only DB dumps in THIS tenant's namespace
822	 * (`${u}_*.sql`) are replayed — so a restore can never touch another tenant's
823	 * database, and the SQL content is our own dump, not anything the tenant could
824	 * have planted (see taskBackup). */
